WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.875
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:05.625
and their managers live together under one roof

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:07.583
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:09.791
and start getting Re-al

00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:10.666
This is

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:11.583
The Champions

00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:13.500
Bayern is not sleeping

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.500
we’re just giving other teams in Bundesliga a head start

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.625
I dress in all black

00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:20.083
because every game is a funeral for the other team

00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:21.416
Right now this show is good

00:00:21.416 --> 00:00:22.208
people are happy

00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:23.500
But wait until Season 3

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.250
things will go very bad

00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:36.166
Now you see it

00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:38.291
Now you don’t!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.625
Obrigado, obrigado

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:46.625
A hat-trick

00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:50.958
Don’t see what the big deal is. I can do that.

00:00:51.291 --> 00:00:53.083
For my final trick

00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:55.333
I need two volunteers

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:56.791
Ow, my shoulder hurts

00:00:56.791 --> 00:01:00.083
Ah...my good friend Mo Salah has volunteered

00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:01.125
No...I was just stretch–

00:01:01.125 --> 00:01:03.875
A round of applause for Mo Salah, everybody, Puskas winner

00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:05.541
Anyone else?

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:07.000
I’ll do it

00:01:07.208 --> 00:01:08.791
Oh, Sergio Ramos wants to

00:01:08.791 --> 00:01:10.125
OK. Come on up.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.833
I’ve got a very bad feeling about this

00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:14.041
Please dim the lights

00:01:14.583 --> 00:01:15.666
Firmino

00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:25.125
And now, let me see. Can Mo go

00:01:25.125 --> 00:01:27.333
from box to box!

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:31.666
Er, please, I would like to leave this box

00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:33.083
No problem, Mo

00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:34.333
Ibra

00:01:34.333 --> 00:01:35.666
Khedira

00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:37.541
El Shaarawy!

00:01:39.291 --> 00:01:40.666
Oh s--t.

00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:41.458
Oh my goodness!

00:01:41.458 --> 00:01:42.125
What is this?

00:01:43.333 --> 00:01:44.000
What?

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:44.916
I’m so sorry

00:01:44.916 --> 00:01:45.875
I don’t know what happened

00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:47.458
Well, can you separate us?!

00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:48.375
I’m not a doctor

00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:49.041
I… I can’t...

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:49.458
What do you mean?

00:01:49.458 --> 00:01:50.916
You caused this! You fix this!

00:01:50.916 --> 00:01:51.791
Sergio, be nice

00:01:51.791 --> 00:01:53.083
You catch more flies with honey than-

00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:53.750
Ow!

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:54.125
What?

00:01:55.166 --> 00:01:55.916
You listen, OK

00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:58.250
If you don’t use your little magician magic to fix this

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:00.000
then I’m going to make YOU disappear

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:00.250
OK

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:03.041
I’m just a little magician, OK, not a BIG magician

00:02:03.041 --> 00:02:05.625
You need a real sorcerer.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:06.500
Take this.

00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:08.750
El Brujo De Porto Alegre

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:09.875
The Great Warlock

00:02:09.875 --> 00:02:11.541
He has tortured me in the past

00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:14.083
And to this day, it still gives me nightmares

00:02:14.083 --> 00:02:15.666
He sounds cool to me!

00:02:17.291 --> 00:02:19.333
This place gives me the creeps, man

00:02:19.333 --> 00:02:21.208
Maybe we should just go see a normal doctor?

00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:22.541
Oh, Mr. Tough Guy

00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:23.416
shaking in his boots

00:02:23.416 --> 00:02:25.916
Listen, you don’t know what this witch is capable of, OK!

00:02:25.916 --> 00:02:28.125
Well, whatever it is, it got him a nice house

00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:32.750
Oh great Jinn, we seek your help

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:36.041
I, Ronaldinho, would be happy to help you-

00:02:36.083 --> 00:02:37.125
Oh!

00:02:37.916 --> 00:02:40.625
We would be most grateful if you could separate us

00:02:40.625 --> 00:02:42.791
If there is anyone in this whole world who knows about

00:02:42.791 --> 00:02:46.250
getting separation from Sergio Ramos, it’s me, baby

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:48.000
Let me see here

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.416
Ay, that’s definitely a curse

00:02:50.416 --> 00:02:50.750
A curse?

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:51.916
Yup. Curse.

00:02:52.166 --> 00:02:53.625
Ah, but the good news is

00:02:53.625 --> 00:02:56.375
that this curse is a lot like Sergio

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.791
It’s very easy to break through

00:03:00.291 --> 00:03:01.625
Sorry...my shoulder is...

00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:02.333
kind of a dick

00:03:02.333 --> 00:03:04.291
Ah, Ramos doesn’t scare me

00:03:04.291 --> 00:03:06.000
His violence is a compliment

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.500
It’s his way of letting you know

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:08.458
he can’t stop you

00:03:08.458 --> 00:03:09.916
Oh, is that right?

00:03:09.916 --> 00:03:11.625
Don’t you make me break your other shoulder

00:03:11.625 --> 00:03:13.083
you one-season wonder!

00:03:13.083 --> 00:03:14.291
At least I am not a cheater!

00:03:14.791 --> 00:03:16.291
OK! OK! Enough, you two!

00:03:16.291 --> 00:03:17.791
Enough, you...one...two...

00:03:17.916 --> 00:03:18.625
Listen

00:03:18.625 --> 00:03:21.291
It seems that when Coutinho did his incantation

00:03:21.291 --> 00:03:23.958
he didn’t account for your animosity towards each other

00:03:23.958 --> 00:03:27.333
You can’t have hatred in your soul when you go box to box

00:03:27.375 --> 00:03:29.875
I learned this lesson well as a man who has two wives

00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:31.041
I can tell you

00:03:31.041 --> 00:03:32.125
But don't worry

00:03:32.125 --> 00:03:33.791
It's very easy to fix

00:03:33.791 --> 00:03:36.666
This curse will be lifted when you, Sergio

00:03:36.666 --> 00:03:39.375
apologize to Mo for injuring his shoulder

00:03:39.375 --> 00:03:40.750
And all you have to do, Mo

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.458
is simply forgive Sergio

00:03:42.458 --> 00:03:43.458
Nah, forget it

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:44.500
Not worth it

